                "prompt": "On an AVR Arduino, unsigned int is 2 bytes. What does this code print?\n\n```\nunsigned int onceki = 65534;\nunsigned int simdi = 3;\n\nvoid setup() {\n  Serial.begin(9600);\n  Serial.println(simdi - onceki);\n}\n\nvoid loop() {}\n```",
