                "term": "State machine (DENGE, KONTROLSUZ, DUSTU)",
                "definition": "A structure in which the program is in exactly one state at any moment. In DENGE (balance) the control runs; in the other states the motors are off.",
                "example": "When the angle goes past the threshold, the program switches to the DUSTU (fell) state, the LED lights up and the motors are cut.",
